; A transaction is dropped when its flag is a currency, when a body line
; starts with tags then a posting, and when a posting has a flag but no
; account; so the balance assertion sees none of them.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 USD "x"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:B

2020-01-03 *
  #tag Assets:A  10 USD
  Assets:B

2020-01-04 *
  ! 10 USD
  Assets:B

2020-01-05 balance Assets:A 0 USD
